# ── Experiment outputs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 생성된 시각화·렌더링·plot (각 챕터)
# Ch1: 3D representation 비교 (mesh vs point cloud vs SDF) · Marching Cubes mesh
# Ch2: Volume rendering 적분 · Beer-Lambert 감쇠 · stratified vs importance
# Ch3: NeRF rendered novel views · positional encoding ablation · NTK spectrum
# Ch4: 3D Gaussian ellipsoid · EWA projection · tile rasterization 타이밍
# Ch5: Nerfies deformation field · 4DGS trajectory · video reconstruction
# Ch6: SDS mode-seeking · VSD diversity · multi-view consistency
# Ch7: LRM single-image 3D · DUSt3R pointmap · application demo
